'''Gentle Mates''' is a [[:Category:France|French]] professional esports organization which entered ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' in August 2025 by signing the [[:Category:Spain|Spanish]] organization-less team [[Iberian Soul]]. <ref name="M8 Iberian Soul">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/gentlemates/status/1960006755905343677|title=GENTLE MATES ARRIVE SUR COUNTER-STRIKE 2 !|trans_title=GENTLE MATES IS COMING TO COUNTER-STRIKE 2!|language={{Flag|fr}} French|date=2025-08-25|author='''Gentle Mates'''}}</ref>

==Timeline==
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2025
|name2=2026
|This=2

|content1=
*August 25th - '''Gentle Mates''' enter ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' with the signing of [[Iberian Soul]], a lineup consisting of [[mopoz]], [[dav1g]], [[sausol]], [[alex (Spanish player)|alex]], [[Martinez]], [[deLonge]] as the head coach, and [[repk3ys]] as the assistant coach. <ref name="M8 Iberian Soul"/>

|content2=
*April 21st - '''Gentle Mates''' bench [[deLonge]]. <ref name="bench deLonge">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/deLongeMVP/status/2046669483167580311|title=Hello everyone, my time as head coach for @gentlemates has come to an end - I've been moved to the bench|date=2026-04-21|author=[[deLonge]]}}</ref>
*July 7th - [[Martinez]] is acquired by [[HEROIC]]. <ref name="-martinez">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/gentlemates/status/2074476135509852316|title=Tes clutchs à l’AWP vont nous manquer|trans_title=We're going to miss your clutch plays with the AWP|language={{Flag|fr}} French|date=2026-07-07|author='''Gentle Mates'''}}</ref>
*August 5th - '''Gentle Mates''' part ways with [[deLonge]] following the expiration of his contract. <ref name="-deLonge">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/deLongeMVP/status/2085063536183800027|title=LFT / Free Agent|date=2026-08-05|author=[[deLonge]]}}</ref>
* August 7th - '''Gentle Mates''' release their roster and announce their departure from the ''Counter-Strike'' scene. <ref name="gentle mates release 2026">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/gentlemates/status/2074476135509852316|title=C’est la fin de notre aventure sur CS2|trans_title=This is the end of our CS2 adventure|language={{Flag|fr}} French|date=2026-08-07|author='''Gentle Mates'''}}</ref>
}}

