'''Grayhound Gaming''' was an [[:Category:Australia|Australian]] esports organization. The organization left the scene in late 2019 after its roster had been bought out by [[Renegades]]. Grayhound returned in 2022 after the acquistion of [[ORDER]]'s roster, who filed for bankruptcy. <ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/n/34414|date=2022-08-17|title=ORDER for sale after entering voluntary administration|author=[[Rizzolini]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref> They ceased operations in 2024. <ref name="shutdown">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/grayhoundgaming/status/1764155236309180634|date=2024-03-03|title=2017 - 2024|author='''Grayhound Gaming'''}}</ref>

==Timeline==
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2017
|name2=2018
|name3=2019
|name4=2022
|name5=2023
|name6=2024
|This=6

|content1=
* June 20th - '''Grayhound Gaming''' enter the ''Counter-Strike'' scene with the signing of the former [[Team Immunity]] roster. <ref name="team immunity">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/grayhoundgaming/status/877089963686338560/|date=2017-06-20|title=#ReleaseTheHounds|author='''Grayhound Gaming'''}}</ref>
* August 3rd - '''Grayhound Gaming''' part ways with [[MoeycQ]]. <ref name="moeycq leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/MoeycQ/status/893031713680408576|date=2017-08-03|title=free agent|author=[[MoeycQ]]}}</ref>
* August 16th - '''Grayhound Gaming''' acquire [[dexter]] from [[Tainted Minds]]. <ref name="dexter joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/grayhoundgaming/status/897739667495305216|date=2017-08-16|title=Ladies and gentleman, please give a warm welcome to our new dawg - Christopher "dexter" Nong!|author='''Grayhound Gaming'''}}</ref>
* October 7th - '''Grayhound Gaming''' bench [[prakM]]. <ref name="Grayhound bench prakM">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/21671/grayhound-bench-prakm|date=2017-10-07|title=Grayhound bench prakM|author=[[flam3z]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
* November 2nd - '''Grayhound Gaming''' part ways with [[MAGIKKK]]. <ref name="magikkk leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/MAGIKKKKKKK/status/925937927951073282|date=2017-11-02|title=No longer coaching Grayhound Gaming|author=[[MAGIKKK]]}}</ref>
* November 14th - '''Grayhound Gaming''' sign [[DickStacy]]. <ref name="dickstacy joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/grayhoundgaming/status/930296028154150917|date=2017-11-14|title=Say hello to our official roster...|author='''Grayhound Gaming'''}}</ref>

|content2=
* February 13th - [[prakM]] is acquired by [[Streamline]]. <ref name="prakm leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/STREAMLINEes/status/963672282781700096|date=2018-02-13|title=We are proud to announce our new CS:GO roster|author=[[Streamline]]}}</ref>
* April 11th - '''Grayhound Gaming''' part ways with [[bURNRUOk]] and acquire [[malta]] from [[Chiefs eSports Club]]. <ref name="bURNRUOk leaves">{{cite web|url=http://www.twitlonger.com/show/n_1sqgfh7|date=2018-04-11|title=As of today I will no longer be representing @grayhoundgaming|author=[[bURNRUOk]]}}</ref><ref name="malta joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/grayhoundgaming/status/984023381031956480|date=2018-04-11|title=We'll shoot first. Please give a warm welcome to.... [malta]|author='''Grayhound Gaming'''}}</ref>
* September 29th - '''Grayhound Gaming''' part ways with [[Gratisfaction]]. <ref name="gratisfaction out">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/grayhoundgaming/status/1045942765111062528|title=Gratisfaction, we wish you nothing but the best in your future|date=2018-09-29|author='''Grayhound Gaming'''}}</ref>
* October 4th - '''Grayhound Gaming''' sign [[sterling]] to complete their lineup. <ref name="grayhound sterling">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/24994/grayhound-confirm-sterling-addition|title=Grayhound confirm sterling addition|author=[[flam3z]]|date=2018-10-04|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>

|content3=
* March 5th - '''Grayhound Gaming''' bench [[sterling]]. <ref name="sterling benched">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/grayhoundgaming/status/1102822132113846272|title=Announcing the departure of the good man @sterl1ngcs|date=2019-03-05|author='''Grayhound Gaming'''}}</ref>
* March 6th - '''Grayhound Gaming''' sign [[sico]] to complete their roster. <ref name="sico joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/grayhoundgaming/status/1103145582288203778|title=@sico_csgo mode|date=2019-03-06|author='''Grayhound Gaming'''}}</ref>
* April 25th - '''Grayhound Gaming''' add [[NeiL_M]] as coach on trial basis. <ref name="NeiL_M Trial">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/grayhoundgaming/status/1121326501431926784|title=@IEM Sydney is coming|date=2019-04-25|author='''Grayhound Gaming'''}}</ref>
* May 6th - '''Grayhound Gaming''' sign [[NeiL_M]] on a permanent basis. <ref name="trial success">{{inside source|date=2019-05-06|lp-date=2019-08-11|source=NeiL_M|lp=source=mnmzzz}}</ref>
* May 13th - [[sterling]] is acquired by [[Avant Gaming]]. <ref name="avant squad 2019">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/AvantGaming/status/1127855100465041408|title=Please join us in welcoming our three newest players to the Avant CS:GO roster...|date=2019-05-14|author=[[Avant Gaming]]}}</ref>
* August 30th - '''Grayhound Gaming''' part ways with [[erkaSt]] after being unsuccessful in obtaining a visa for him to live in Australia. <ref name="erkaSt leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/grayhoundgaming/status/1167340890580369408|title=Erdenetsogt "@erkaStCSGO" Gantulga. We hope this is a story you'll one day tell the kids. We'll see you around, we know it|date=2019-08-30|author='''Grayhound Gaming'''}}</ref>
* September 5th - '''Grayhound Gaming''' part ways with [[NeiL_M]]. <ref name="NeiL_M leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NeiL_Mcs/status/1169569456462467072|title=As of today i won't be part of @grayhoundgaming as we part ways.|date=2019-09-05|author=[[NeiL_M]]}}</ref>
* September 11th - '''Grayhound Gaming''' sign [[INS]]. <ref name="INS joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/grayhoundgaming/status/1171637955804504066|title=Dear Hounds|date=2019-09-11|author='''Grayhound Gaming'''}}</ref>
* December 3rd - '''Grayhound Gaming'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s roster is acquired by [[Renegades]]. <ref name="Renegades CSGO">{{cite web|url=https://www.renegadespro.com/blogs/videos/renegades-cs-go-a-new-era|title=Renegades CS:GO A New Era|date=2019-12-03|publisher=[[Renegades]]}}</ref>

|content4=
* September 2nd - [[ORDER]]<nowiki>'</nowiki>s lineup officially starts playing under the banner of '''Grayhound Gaming'''. <ref name="Grayhound returns">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/grayhoundgaming/status/1565559336554070016|date=2022-09-02|title=ATTENTION HOUNDS...|author='''Grayhound Gaming'''}}</ref>

|content5=
*February 12th - '''Grayhound Gaming''' part ways with [[Kingfisher]]. <ref name="-Kingfisher">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Kingfisheroce/status/1624615041625645056|date=2023-02-12|title=Parting ways with Grayhound|author=[[Kingfisher]]}}</ref>
*November 13th - '''Grayhound Gaming''' re-sign [[erkaSt]] as their new coach. <ref name="+erkaSt">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/grayhoundgaming/status/1723986927026856179|date=2023-11-13|title=WELCOME HOME, @ERKASTCSGO|author='''Grayhound Gaming'''}}</ref>
*December 11th - '''Grayhound Gaming''' part ways with [[Sico]]. <ref name="-Sico">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/grayhoundgaming/status/1734122432364233208|date=2023-12-11|title=Simon "@sico_csgo " Williams|author='''Grayhound Gaming'''}}</ref>
*December 12th - '''Grayhound Gaming''' acquire [[dexter]] from [[Fnatic]]. <ref name="+dexter">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/grayhoundgaming/status/1734483014879781219|title=EPISODE III: REVENGE OF DEXTER|date=2023-12-12|author='''Grayhound Gaming'''}}</ref>

|content6=
*March 3rd - '''Grayhound Gaming''' cease operations and release their lineup. <ref name="shutdown"/>
}}

