*May 28th - '''Inner Circle Esports''' bench [[lmbt]]. <ref name="lmbt bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/incircleesports/status/1927711694576300092|title=We’ve got an update on our CS2 roster|date=2025-05-28|author='''Inner Circle Esports'''}}</ref>
