*September 22nd - '''Inner Circle Esports''' part ways with [[nawrot]]. <ref name="-nawrot">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/nawrot_cs/status/1970119946580680854|title=As of today I'm no longer under contract in @InCircleEsports|date=2025-09-22|author=[[nawrot]]}}</ref>
*September 25th - '''Inner Circle Esports''' acquire [[TEAM NEXT LEVEL]] organization, as a result, the latter's lineup is transferred over to the former. <ref name="+tnl">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/InCircleEsports/status/1971220526853972377|title=For those who are waiting for CS2 roster announcement|date=2025-09-25|author='''Inner Circle Esports'''}}</ref>
