*January 23rd - '''Inner Circle Esports''' part ways with [[kane]]. <ref name="-kane">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/InCircleEsports/status/2014760083121492086|title=Our journey with Mykhailo "Kane" Blahin has come to an end|date=2026-01-23|author='''Inner Circle Esports'''}}</ref>
