*March 14th - '''Inner Circle Esports''' sign [[headtr1ck]]. <ref name="+headtr1ck">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/InCircleEsports/status/2032789406914937075|title=Look who we got here|date=2026-03-14|author='''Inner Circle Esports'''}}</ref>
