'''Imperial Female''' (currently known as '''Gamdom Imperial Female''' for sponsorship reasons and formerly stylized as  '''Imperial Valkyries''' and '''Imperial Esports Female''') is the women's team of professional [[:Category:Brazil|Brazilian]] esports organization [[Imperial Esports]]. 

